 - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:31.97,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:46.33,Title,,0,0,250,,Secret PlanDialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:51.37,Captions,,935,0,238,,Outside the palace                4th step - Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll leave that guy up to you, soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Straw Hatter.Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How nice that you got to see your dad!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the key!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:16.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to...Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to take down Doflamingo?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It ain't "Lucy".Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.14,0:02:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Name's Luffy! The man who's gonna be the Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So don't worry!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate King?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:53.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm your opponent, Diamante!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:03:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you seriously think I'll let you reach the palace?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You tremendous idiot! And the traitorous brat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:09.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Room!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:28.15,Captions,,0,480,297,,Royal palace                Pool courtyardDialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:26.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this... the palace?Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we finally made it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What a useful ability!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:33.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It is, but it also eats up my energy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose having those sea stone cuffs on and getting carried by you to this point wasn't so bad after all.Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I was able to save my energy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:46.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Scalpel!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I operated on myself.Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He purposely used lead bullets... That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go kick Mingo's ass!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What now?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo isn't someone that you can just beat with willpower alone.Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to cool down.Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! How can I "cool down" after coming this far?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, if you don't, you can't defeat him!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I promised Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:28.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What good will standing still here do us?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Law and Straw Hat have shown up in the yard, near the pool.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:34.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that.Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ten years... Ten whole years...Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:45.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I spent such a long time adding to my collection, little by little.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Tens of thousands of toy slaves!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But that idiot...Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Brought it all to naught in an instant!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Getting revenge will be easy.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I just have to touch him.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats...Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:14.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make it so that...Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,all of you...Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,never existed!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.14,Captions,,50,0,385,,Former Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp-dono, is it that serious of a problem?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It sent chills down my spine...Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:35.95,Main,,0,0,0,,To think about how Robin was turned into a toy earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't even realize I had forgotten about her!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If Sugar touches Luffy, I'll forget about him like that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:49.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Your friend disappears, and you won't even know it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let that happen!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't we tell them through the Snail Phone?Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been calling them, but they haven't noticed!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a choice!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just shoot her from here!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Usopp-dono, shooting her from here would be...Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I can barely see the palace with my naked eye.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,And the enemy is behind the wall. I can't even see her!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard it is, I've gotta do it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll assist you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a sniper!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Covering someone is what I do best!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:40.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Protecting my friends by shooting enemies from a distance!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:42.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Tank! Hack!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, my king!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand! We'll protect Usopp-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The citizens are nearly here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:58.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody's confused.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,They may come after me, too.Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,But don't harm anyone.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That might be difficult.Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,All we need to do now is buy time for the shot.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I owe you one, old king!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar is getting closer!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,She can see them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on her!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Made it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:29.49,Main,,0,0,0,,There!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,God Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Seize them all and hand them over to Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We must assist as well!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar came out into the yard!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The time has come!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:05.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!  None of us will run!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me the exact location of the courtyard!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.91,Main,,0,0,0,,People, come to your senses!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,See the windows on the upper part of the Rampart Tower?Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I see Straw Hat and Law in the first window right of the center.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,There are iron bars on the window.Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,How many bars are there?Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:40.77,Main,,0,0,0,,One vertical bar and three horizontal bars.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:47.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The length from the ground of the yard to the bottom of the window is about 1.2 meters.Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That's about Sugar's height.Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:54.61,Main,,0,0,0,,How big is the bottom pane of the window?Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,50 wide by 40 high.Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:04.26,Main,,0,0,0,,She'll be able to touch them at any second!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:06.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The target is behind that wall...Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If I miss, we'll lose Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:25.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'd never want to sail an ocean without you on it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Who will save this country?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You just watch, Sugar!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I won't let you guys...Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:36.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,have it your way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:46.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's... going on?Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can see...Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:01.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,their presences!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:03.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Super Grow Up Great Black Kabuto!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure-Kill Long-Range Bagworm!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing from west to east...Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Wind force: Four.Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A slight tailwind.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:41.12,Secondary,,0,0,0,,We got him!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:42.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Two...Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:43.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,One...Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,First booster, Exploding Star!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:50.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It ascends slightly, and the back is jettisoned.Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:54.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Two seconds later, the second booster ignites!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:59.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The outer cover comes off and the bullet travels horizontally.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It'll pass through the lower left side of the window on the Rampart Tower!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:08.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Through the wall, straight on!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.85,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Straight to the target!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It trails off a little, but this special round is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Designed to re-traumatize the enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:34.71,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you don't even have to notice...Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:36.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,As long as you're alright,Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:40.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,just ignore it and carry on!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:49.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But, Usopp-dono, what are you planning to do with this drawing?Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:52.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Can you turn it into a doll?Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:53.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A doll?Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:57.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Do it! This'll be my bullet!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! She passed out again!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:15.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Usopp-kun! You're unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it! You brought down Sugar!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he really?! I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I am truly stunned!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he really prevail?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Great...Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,How are they?Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.20,Main,,0,0,0,,They're both fine.Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,They've just made it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,To the top floor of the palace, the stage for the final battle!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You did it, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should ask...Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Just in case I'm wrong...Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:08.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What...Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,did you two come here for?Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,To kick your ass!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Likewise!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.88,Captions,,910,0,215,,3rd step                   New Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:29.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they just falling apart?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The toys...Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought they were big for toys.Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So each of them was put together from eight people.Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:44.77,Main,,0,0,0,,They turned their own men into toys?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:47.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Just how little do they value their soldiers?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Impossible...Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar fainted again?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar-sama, stay with us!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It was terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought we'd be toys forever.Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We planned to return you to normal once the battle was over, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:14.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's what I thought!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:24.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Of course, we completely forgot about them.Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:29.35,Main,,0,0,0,,My barrier is fully recharged!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:34.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you guys ascend any farther!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:46.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Top Floor of the Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:51.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why so concerned?Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you two clashed in Mock Town.Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,When did you two become friends?Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're such a delusional dumbass!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:19.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen up! The era where pirates dream is over!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all in the past.Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Let Bellamy go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,up to the winner to decide!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:40.19,Main,,0,0,0,,This fool came to me to get killed.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:47.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,In order to survive the coming wave, I'm gonna ride on Doflamingo's ship.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't laugh at you anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:56.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I've looked up to Doflamingo ever since I was a kid.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I have too much respect for him.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:08.11,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how you take responsibility, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You idolized me of your own will...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:18.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And became desperate when things didn't go as you'd hoped.Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,People can't change their nature.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how far you go, you're just a cheap thug.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:28.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! Bellamy has changed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay now.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Just...Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:42.07,Main,,0,0,0,,kill me...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,already...Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:52.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Mingo!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't we agree on this earlier?Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:05.82,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get carried away by anger and hate, you're playing right into his hands.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Suppress it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Getting us riled up is his plan.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Losing your cool here could get you killed.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:18.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I almost did when I fought him previously.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is a cold-blooded, ruthless man.Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He's always looking for a chance to get you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The face of your dying friend...Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:40.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You kicked him! Didn't you? Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:43.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You just kicked him!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you say I'm cold-blooded!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:18:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, I'm not as cold-blooded as you think.Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I've actually reached my boiling point.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about what you guys have done.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,First, you began by destroying the SAD manufacturing machine on Punk Hazard.Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, you took out Vergo and Monet...Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And kidnapped Caesar.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Lastly, you freed the toys throughout the country of Dressrosa.Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Even now, your associates are trying to destroy the Smile factory!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough already!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm smiling because I can't be any more pissed!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, you think you can actually kill me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:50.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been disastrous since you guys came along.Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:57.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm reliving the despair of thirteen years ago!Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,If that hadn't happened, I wouldn't have shown up in front of you like this!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If that hadn't happened, you would've been here as the third Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:28.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Knight!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:31.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The clone again?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I will...Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Fight the real one!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.03,0:19:53.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, why're you doing this, Bellamy?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I said sorry for what I did!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:19:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He's being controlled!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:10.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:12.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you know him but...Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna stop him, you gotta knock him out!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Just do it! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're already one foot in the grave.Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Not a bad way to die, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what I once told you, Law?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:08.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The weak have no choice in how they die!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We came this far, but you still won't fight us yourself?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:22.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Traf!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick his ass now!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm pissed off!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn fool! I told you, it's our secret plan!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And I told you not to get carried away!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.99,0:21:37.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:46.27,Main,,0,0,0,,He's going to attack Law!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:48.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going nuts, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is fun!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Room!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:21:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Red Hawk!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.73,0:22:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Radio Knife.Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:30.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter! You're the worst!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Same to you...Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.05,0:22:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We're from that generation!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:41.40,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi  QC: Mr. Luffy, Sewil  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi